    "exact": "The pinned generated setters name all 20 icon members and the nested priority fields. The selected current reader gates a 20-member wrapper, reads the direct raw12 native-value priority layout, a signed StringPool index for spritePath through the proved pooled string helper, enum-like DWORDs, and booleans in the recorded order. Exact cursors must end at the independently selected following id field.",
